>Bacteria_CYP165D3 Bacteria OxyE;Teicoplanin is distinguished from the vancomycin-type glycopeptide antibiotics, by the presence of an additional cross-link between the aromatic amino acids 1 and 3 that is catalyzed by the cytochrome P450 monooxygenase Orf6* (CYP165D3) pdb_id=3o1a_A [Actinoplanes teichomyceticus]

